sequenceDiagram
  participant P as parent
  participant B as detached broker
  participant A as allocation.json
  participant D as decision.json
  participant G as launch gate
  participant C as child

  P->>P: preflight and private inputs
  P->>B: immutable launch intent
  B->>B: claim broker ownership
  B->>B: allocate exact target
  B->>A: allocation first publish
  par commit and cancel race
    P->>D: commit or cancel
    B->>D: commit or cancel
  end
  alt cancel wins
    B->>B: rollback exact target
  else commit wins
    B->>P: committed launch
    P->>G: publish gate
    P->>C: start child after gate
  end
